description: "And([WithComponent(\"ecsdb::A\"), Or([WithComponent(\"ecsdb::B\"), WithComponent(\"ecsdb::C\")])]).sql_query()"
---
SqlFragment<ecsdb::query::ir::Select> {
    sql: "select entity from components where (component = :1 and ((select true from components c2 where c2.entity = components.entity and c2.component = :2) or (select true from components c2 where c2.entity = components.entity and c2.component = :3)))",
